  "title": "Linear gate-loop resonance and drain-to-gate capacitive injection",
  "source": ".title Linear gate-loop resonance and drain-to-gate capacitive injection\nVgate command 0 PULSE(0 12 100n 10n 10n 400n 1u)\nRdriver command gate_lead 2\nLpackage gate_lead gate 20n\nCgs gate 0 2n\nCgd gate drain 100p\nVdrain drain 0 PULSE(72 0 200n 5n 5n 400n 1u)\nRleak gate 0 1G\n.tran 1n 3u uic\n.end\n",
